cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use any Trinity VSA discoveries, please cite our defensive publication."
title: "VSA Operations for Ternary Computing"
abstract: "This bundle presents Trinity's Vector Symbolic Architecture (VSA) operations adapted for ternary computing, featuring bind/unbind operations using HybridBigInt SIMD for efficient associative memory, bundle operations (2-ary, 3-ary) for majority voting and noise resilience, ternary dot-product for {-1,0,+1} vector operations, cyclic permutation encoding for position-independent representation, cosine similarity for ternary vector comparison, and text encoding mapping characters to Vec32i8 VSA representations. All innovations published as defensive prior art with Zenodo DOIs."
